# 基础词 Unit07
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023红宝书考研英语词汇-基础词
# 描述: 基础词Unit07核心词汇

{{blend}}{/blend/}{{v. 混合；n. 混合物}}{{Blend the ingredients together until smooth.}}
{{blind}}{/blaɪnd/}{{adj. 盲的；v. 使失明}}{{The bright light blinded him for a moment.}}
{{block}}{/blɒk/}{{n. 街区；块；v. 阻碍}}{{A fallen tree blocked the road completely.}}
{{blood}}{/blʌd/}{{n. 血液}}{{Blood carries oxygen to all parts of the body.}}
{{blow}}{/bləʊ/}{{v. 吹；打击；n. 打击}}{{The wind blew the leaves off the trees.}}
{{blue}}{/bluː/}{{adj. 蓝色的；忧郁的}}{{The sky was clear and blue that day.}}
{{board}}{/bɔːrd/}{{n. 板；董事会；v. 上船（飞机）}}{{Passengers began to board the plane at 9 a.m.}}
{{boat}}{/bəʊt/}{{n. 小船；艇}}{{They sailed across the lake in a small boat.}}
{{body}}{/ˈbɒdi/}{{n. 身体；主体}}{{Regular exercise keeps the body healthy.}}
{{boil}}{/bɔɪl/}{{v. 沸腾；煮沸}}{{Boil the water before making tea.}}
{{bold}}{/bəʊld/}{{adj. 大胆的；醒目的}}{{She made a bold decision to start her own business.}}
{{bomb}}{/bɒm/}{{n. 炸弹；v. 轰炸}}{{The bomb was safely defused by the experts.}}
{{bond}}{/bɒnd/}{{n. 纽带；债券；v. 结合}}{{The bond between mother and child is very strong.}}
{{bone}}{/bəʊn/}{{n. 骨头；骨骼}}{{The dog buried the bone in the garden.}}
{{book}}{/bʊk/}{{n. 书；v. 预订}}{{I booked a table at the restaurant for tonight.}}
{{border}}{/ˈbɔːrdər/}{{n. 边界；边缘}}{{The river forms the border between the two countries.}}
{{bore}}{/bɔːr/}{{v. 使厌烦；钻孔；n. 令人讨厌的人或物}}{{The long speech bored the audience.}}
{{born}}{/bɔːrn/}{{adj. 出生的；天生的}}{{She was born in a small town in southern China.}}
{{borrow}}{/ˈbɒrəʊ/}{{v. 借入；借用}}{{Can I borrow your pen for a moment?}}
{{boss}}{/bɒs/}{{n. 老板；上司}}{{My boss is very understanding and supportive.}}
{{both}}{/bəʊθ/}{{adj./pron. 两个都}}{{Both students passed the exam with high scores.}}
{{bother}}{/ˈbɒðər/}{{v. 打扰；烦恼；n. 麻烦}}{{I'm sorry to bother you, but could you help me?}}
{{bottle}}{/ˈbɒtl/}{{n. 瓶子}}{{She drank a whole bottle of water after the run.}}
{{bottom}}{/ˈbɒtəm/}{{n. 底部；adj. 最低的}}{{The ship sank to the bottom of the ocean.}}
{{bounce}}{/baʊns/}{{v. 弹跳；n. 弹力}}{{The ball bounced off the wall and rolled away.}}
{{bound}}{/baʊnd/}{{adj. 一定的；受约束的；n. 界限}}{{He is bound to succeed with such determination.}}
{{boundary}}{/ˈbaʊndri/}{{n. 边界；分界线}}{{The fence marks the boundary of the property.}}
{{bow}}{/baʊ/}{{v. 鞠躬；n. 弓；蝴蝶结}}{{She took a bow after her wonderful performance.}}
{{brain}}{/breɪn/}{{n. 大脑；智力}}{{The human brain is incredibly complex.}}
{{branch}}{/brɑːntʃ/}{{n. 树枝；分支；v. 分岔}}{{The bank has branches all over the country.}}
{{brand}}{/brænd/}{{n. 品牌；商标}}{{This brand of coffee is very popular in Europe.}}
{{brave}}{/breɪv/}{{adj. 勇敢的}}{{The brave firefighter rescued the child from the fire.}}
{{bread}}{/bred/}{{n. 面包}}{{She bought a loaf of fresh bread from the bakery.}}
{{break}}{/breɪk/}{{v. 打破；n. 休息；破裂}}{{Let's take a short break and continue later.}}
{{breakfast}}{/ˈbrekfəst/}{{n. 早餐}}{{I usually have cereal and fruit for breakfast.}}
{{breath}}{/breθ/}{{n. 呼吸；气息}}{{He took a deep breath before diving into the pool.}}
{{breathe}}{/briːð/}{{v. 呼吸}}{{It's important to breathe deeply during meditation.}}
{{breed}}{/briːd/}{{v. 繁殖；n. 品种}}{{This breed of dog is known for its intelligence.}}
{{brick}}{/brɪk/}{{n. 砖；砖块}}{{The old house was made of red bricks.}}
{{bridge}}{/brɪdʒ/}{{n. 桥；桥梁}}{{The bridge connects the two sides of the city.}}
